<!doctype html><title>Positioned image slots</title><style>body{margin:4px}.card{display:block;position:relative;width:100%;height:0;padding-top:50%;background:#ddd}.card img{display:block;position:absolute;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}</style><body><p>Two cards whose photos fill boxes their containers size.</p><span class=card><picture><img id=first alt="First card photo" src=/first.jpg width=240 height=134></picture></span><span class=card><img id=second alt="Second card photo" src=/second.jpg width=240 height=134></span><script>setInterval(function(){},1000)</script></body>